OL,3,ABritish national arrested in connection
OL,4,Awith RAF Fairford incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major incident was declared and
OL,7,Fdozens of homes were evacuated after
OL,8,Fpolice were alerted to three
OL,9,F"suspicious vehicles" near the airbase.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
