OL,3,ATories pledge #10bn for British
OL,4,Aanti-missile defence system
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Conservatives have pledged to
OL,7,Finvest #10bn in a system to defend
OL,8,FBritain against long-range missiles and
OL,9,Fdrones, if they win the next general
OL,10,Felection.
OL,12,FThe party said the "Britannia Shield"
OL,13,Fwould offer the UK an integrated
OL,14,Fnetwork of radar, command and control
OL,15,Fsystems, as well as interceptor
OL,16,Fmissiles.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
