OL,3,ALawyer for one of Cornell 7 calls for
OL,4,Aspecial prosecutor to be removed over
OL,5,Aprevious comments
OL,6,
OL,7,FA lawyer for one of the seven men
OL,8,Faccused of participating in a Cornell
OL,9,FUniversity gang rape has called for the
OL,10,Fspecial prosecutor on the case to
OL,11,Frecuse herself over past public
OL,12,Fcomments.
OL,14,FThe lawyer had said a social media post
OL,15,Ffrom New York Attorney General Letitia
OL,16,FJames throws into question her
OL,17,Finvestigation's "integrity and
OL,18,Findependence".
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
