OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ALawyer for one of Cornell 7 calls for
OL,4,Aspecial prosecutor to be removed over
OL,5,Aprevious comments
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn the 28 September post, James wrote
OL,8,Fthat "what this young woman has been
OL,9,Fforced to endure is horrific and
OL,10,Funacceptable" and told survivors that
OL,11,F"we stand with you".
OL,13,FThe university's administration is
OL,14,Funder fire over its alleged mishandling
OL,15,Fof the October 2024 incident and,
OL,16,Faccording to US media, now faces a
OL,17,Fno-confidence vote by Cornell faculty.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
